[1.201522,"o","\u001b[39;49m\u001b]104\u0007\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mHow would you like to set up Hermes?\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → (●) Quick Setup (Nous Portal) — free OAuth login, no API keys, model + tools\u001b[5;4H\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m(○) Full setup — configure every provider, tool & option yourself (bring you\u001b[6;4H(○) Blank Slate — everything off except the bare minimum; opt in to each cap\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b[39;49m\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33mSelect terminal backend:\r\u001b[2d\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;2m  ↑↓ navigate  ENTER/SPACE select  ESC cancel\u001b[4;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m(○) Local - run directly on this machine (default)\u001b[5;4H(○) Docker - isolated container with configurable resources\u001b[6;4H(○) Modal - serverless cloud sandbox\u001b[7;4H(○) SSH - run on a remote machine\u001b[8;4H(○) Daytona - persistent cloud development environment\u001b[9;4H(○) Vercel Sandbox - cloud microVM with snapshot filesystem persistence\u001b[10;4H(○) Singularity/Apptainer - HPC-friendly container\r\u001b[11d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m → (●) Keep current (local)\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
